  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_sub073_beasttamer_01",
      "hash": "b42e6c6f487cb7ba",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "嚯……你的[VAR POKNAME(0003)]\\n长了一双漂亮的眼睛啊……\\c\\n这孩子一定能学会由我创造出的\\n棒呆了的招式哦！\\c\\n怎么说？想让[VAR POKNAME(0003)]\\n学学看棒呆了的招式吗？"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_sub073_beasttamer_02",
      "hash": "b42e6b6f487cb607",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "嘿！你们想好没？\\c\\n要让那只[VAR POKNAME(0003)]\\n学学看棒呆了的招式吗？"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_sub073_beasttamer_03",
      "hash": "b42e6a6f487cb454",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……哎呀哎呀，怎么回事？\\c\\n[VAR POKNAME(0003)]现在看来\\n没有这个需要啊。"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_sub073_beasttamer_04",
      "hash": "b42e696f487cb2a1",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR PKNICK(0000)]想要学习\\n[VAR MOVE(0001)]……\\c\\n为了学习[VAR MOVE(0001)]，\\n要忘记其他的招式吗？"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_sub073_beasttamer_05",
      "hash": "b42e686f487cb0ee",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR PKNICK(0000)]\\n学会了[VAR MOVE(0001)]！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_sub073_beasttamer_06",
      "hash": "b42e676f487caf3b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "１[WAIT 20]，２[WAIT 20]…[WAIT 20]…[WAIT 20]空！[VAR SFX(0003)][VAR SFX(0000)]\\c\\n[VAR PKNICK(0000)]\\n把[VAR MOVE(0002)]的\\r\\n使用方法忘得干干净净了！\\c\\n于是……！\\c\\n[VAR PKNICK(0000)]学会了\\n[VAR MOVE(0001)]！[VAR SFX(0004)][VAR SFX(0001)]"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_sub073_beasttamer_07",
      "hash": "b42e666f487cad88",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR PKNICK(0000)]没有学习\\n[VAR MOVE(0001)]就结束了！"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_sub073_beasttamer_08",
      "hash": "b42e656f487cabd5",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "棒呆了的关系……\\n你和你的宝可梦值得铸造！"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_sub073_beasttamer_09",
      "hash": "b42e646f487caa22",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "这样啊……\\n改变主意的时候记得再来！"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_sub073_beasttamer_10",
      "hash": "b42ae76f48799fe4",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "想要教它哪个招式？"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_sub073_pikachu_waza01",
      "hash": "8e958673bda5c3f2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "闪闪雷光"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_sub073_pikachu_waza02",
      "hash": "8e958573bda5c23f",
